#question(title: [Extrema], centered: true)[
  In each of the following cases, does the
  function $f$ have a maximum and a minimum
  on the interval $I$?

  + $display(f(x) = x^2)$, #h(1em)
    $display(I = (- 1 comma 1))$.
  + $display(f(x) = ((e^x + 2) sin x)/x - cos x + 3)$,
    #h(1em) $display(I = [2 comma 6])$
  + $display(f(x) = ((e^x + 2) sin x)/x - cos x + 3)$,
    #h(1em) $display(I = (0 comma 5])$
]
